        {
          "id": "e5631b9e-9156-463c-8836-1b9a003dd7ed",
          "name": "BigCommerce Create a New Coupon",
          "request": {
            "name": "BigCommerce Create a New Coupon",
            "description": {
              "content": "Creates a *Coupon*.\n\n**Required Fields**\n*   `name`\n*   `code`\n*   `type`\n*   `amount`\n*   `applies_to`\n\n**Read Only Fields**\n*   `id`\n*   `num_uses`\n\n**Notes**\n\nThe coupon type can be one of the following:\n\n*   `per_item_discount`\n*   `per_total_discount`\n*   `shipping_discount`\n*   `free_shipping`\n*   `percentage_discount`\n\nLegacy coupon codes only work with the store's default currency. Applying a coupon with any other currency other than the store's default will result in the error: \"Coupons only apply to default currency.\"",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "coupons"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "description": "Permanent ID of the BigCommerce store.",
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "{{store_hash}}",
                  "key": "store_hash"
                }
              ]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": null,
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": \"<string>\",\n  \"applies_to\": {\n    \"ids\": [\n      \"<integer>\",\n      \"<integer>\"\n    ],\n    \"entity\": \"<string>\"\n  },\n  \"code\": \"<string>\",\n  \"name\": \"<string>\",\n  \"type\": \"<string>\",\n  \"min_purchase\": \"<string>\",\n  \"expires\": \"<string>\",\n  \"enabled\": \"<boolean>\",\n  \"max_uses\": \"<integer>\",\n  \"max_uses_per_customer\": \"<integer>\",\n  \"restricted_to\": {\n    \"countries\": \"<string>\"\n  },\n  \"shipping_methods\": [\n    \"<string>\",\n    \"<string>\"\n  ]\n}",
